{"4241760":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PolyDogfight","steam_appid":4241760,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT IS POLYDOGFIGHT?<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PolyDogfight is an arcade game where you shoot down waves of enemy planes in an open-air arena to get the highest score possible. As you play, you will anticipate your enemies spawn and attack patterns to destroy them with speed and elegance. The faster you beat down waves of planes, the higher your score! Will you challenge the global leaderboard?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DOGFIGHT!<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to increase your score multiplier, the more enemies you beat quickly the higher your multiplier will be. Each map has its own unique wave pattern of enemies to memorize and beat down in style. Collect powerups that give you an advantage. Dodge bullets and lasers with precision. Get insane combos and millions of points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UNLOCK NEW PLANES &amp; MAPS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique low poly maps with their own leaderboard, music, and enemies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unique low poly planes with different combinations of stats, body style, weapon, and color<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMPATIBILITY &amp; ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game can be played at resolutions as low as <strong>480p <\/strong>or high as <strong>4k<\/strong>, in all <strong>common aspect ratios (21:9, 16:9, 4:3, 3:2) <\/strong>with <strong>vertical aspect ratio<\/strong> support. Looks and plays great at <strong>low (30hz)<\/strong> or <strong>high (144hz+) frame rates<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is <strong>easy to run<\/strong> and can run on integrated graphics, modern android mobile devices, Steam Deck, desktop PCs and laptops. (depending on frame rate and resolution desired, see graphics for more info)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of control options: <strong>Mouse only<\/strong> support, <strong>touch only<\/strong> support, <strong>controller <\/strong>support, or <strong>mouse +<\/strong> <strong>keyboard<\/strong> support, each fully functional in menus and in game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About Development<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/2e598c40c894250289c3c3d855af47ea.avif?t=1793643034\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras_big\/2e598c40c894250289c3c3d855af47ea.webp?t=1793643034 width=1560 height=400 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PolyDogfight was designed, developed, and created by a ndelaplace, a solo developer using the Unity game engine, Blender, Krita, and Visual Studio and the use of some premade assets. Full credits can be found in game\/demo. No generative AI was used during the development of this game including code, design, music, 3d models, or 2d art. Made by humans for humans.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/f2b43fac3909078a6e9d973c0c748794.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT IS POLYDOGFIGHT?<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PolyDogfight is an arcade game where you shoot down waves of enemy planes in an open-air arena to get the highest score possible. As you play, you will anticipate your enemies spawn and attack patterns to destroy them with speed and elegance. The faster you beat down waves of planes, the higher your score! Will you challenge the global leaderboard?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/d424938b10ed9e888d4d3a872928c041.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DOGFIGHT!<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to increase your score multiplier, the more enemies you beat quickly the higher your multiplier will be. Each map has its own unique wave pattern of enemies to memorize and beat down in style. Collect powerups that give you an advantage. Dodge bullets and lasers with precision. Get insane combos and millions of points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.poster.avif?t=1793643034\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.webm?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/1c263e6b8757876c9f0ee6dd9cce0767.mp4?t=1793643034\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UNLOCK NEW PLANES &amp; MAPS<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique low poly maps with their own leaderboard, music, and enemies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unique low poly planes with different combinations of stats, body style, weapon, and color<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMPATIBILITY &amp; ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game can be played at resolutions as low as <strong>480p <\/strong>or high as <strong>4k<\/strong>, in all <strong>common aspect ratios (21:9, 16:9, 4:3, 3:2) <\/strong>with <strong>vertical aspect ratio<\/strong> support. Looks and plays great at <strong>low (30hz)<\/strong> or <strong>high (144hz+) frame rates<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is <strong>easy to run<\/strong> and can run on integrated graphics, modern android mobile devices, Steam Deck, desktop PCs and laptops. (depending on frame rate and resolution desired, see graphics for more info)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of control options: <strong>Mouse only<\/strong> support, <strong>touch only<\/strong> support, <strong>controller <\/strong>support, or <strong>mouse +<\/strong> <strong>keyboard<\/strong> support, each fully functional in menus and in game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About Development<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras\/2e598c40c894250289c3c3d855af47ea.avif?t=1793643034\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/extras_big\/2e598c40c894250289c3c3d855af47ea.webp?t=1793643034 width=1560 height=400 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PolyDogfight was designed, developed, and created by a ndelaplace, a solo developer using the Unity game engine, Blender, Krita, and Visual Studio and the use of some premade assets. Full credits can be found in game\/demo. No generative AI was used during the development of this game including code, design, music, 3d models, or 2d art. Made by humans for humans.<\/p>","short_description":"Prepare to Fly, Dodge, Shoot, and Destroy in PolyDogfight. Unlock all the planes and maps to find your style. Obliterate waves of planes in an open-air arena as quickly as possible to get the high score and top the global leaderboard!","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/3ae7721d3147a326d010a580058abd6955992ff6\/header.jpg?t=1793643034","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/29fb31e0e67f04de753570ae6d9e02dff17a5d01\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793643034","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4241760\/29fb31e0e67f04de753570ae6d9e02dff17a5d01\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793643034","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li